# Store text files with LF in the repository and check them out with LF on
# every platform. Without this, Windows editors and tools rewrite the whole
# tree with CRLF, and `git diff` reports a whitespace-only diff for every file
# (6300+ lines), which makes review and `git status` useless.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be converted or diffed as text.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico  binary
*.bmp  binary
